    "description": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 396pt; height: 42px;\" border=\"0\" width=\"528\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><colgroup><col style=\"mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 3218; width: 66pt;\" span=\"6\" width=\"88\"> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 21px; width: 396pt;\" colspan=\"6\" width=\"528\" height=\"21\">Drop Items</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 21px;\" height=\"21\">Fixed</td>\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"height: 21px;\" colspan=\"5\">Strange Bone Helmet[Valuable] (30G)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">▼Explanation</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">A raiding force of Green Goblins attacks a village of Earthlings.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">During this time, the Green Goblin is summoned to destroy the barrier.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">artillerymen&gt;.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">The portable stone trebuchet he carried on his back was from Midori Elementary School.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">A type of weapon created by Oni's engineers, which can be used for bows and magic.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">It is possible to fire unilaterally from a short distance.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Usually a cannonball is a stone about the size of an armful, but the surrounding</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Throw away anything that can be used, such as debris and junk.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">It's coming.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Bombing enemy groups in addition to attacking bases</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">He does not hesitate to involve his allies at the point of impact.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Because they cannot protect themselves if approached, they often attack other</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">A demon is accompanying him as a bodyguard.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">In particular, it supports artillery bombardment.</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">The collaboration with the Green Goblin Observer is outstanding, and the adventure</span></span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">It would also be a threat to people.</span></span></p>"
  },
